window.products.push({"id":237304,"name":"Polish Pottery Bowl 7-inch Kitty Paws","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P3U2jCjwL._AC_SL1248_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery -inch Bowl Boo Boo Kitty Paws Theme Certificate of Authenticity and origin is included Dimensions: 2.76\" high, 6.97\" wide, 6.97\" long, (max. outside edge or handle) Capacity: 32oz (filled to the rim) Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns. These patterns bear the artist’s signature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P3U2jCjwL._AC_SL1248_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B01D99GL9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01D99GL9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01D99GL9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":237305,"name":"Bonefish Gear Vacuum Insulated True Pint, 16 oz, Coated Stainless Steel (Deep Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l7H6A7feL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Not All Stainless Steel Pints Are Equal! All Bonefish Gear products are made from strong, high quality, 18/8 food grade stainless steel. Most cups and flasks on the market are made with lower grade metal tops and bottoms even if the body is 18/8 stainless steel. Use of this high quality stainless steel virtually eliminates the release of potential toxins associated with lower-quality corrodible metals. In addition, our solid stainless steel cap is threaded for long life durability. Lower quality metal containers are capable of leaching toxic heavy metals into the containerÍs contents. If lesser quality alloys and metals (including some types of stainless steel) with less corrosion/leaching resistance than 18/8 or 304 are used, the container may leach a variety of highly toxic heavy metals into the stored content such as lead, antimony, cobalt, etc. Ingestion of these toxic heavy metals can cause severe health issues. Currently, there are many metal cups being sold on the market as a healthy substitute for plastic and glass containers. However, please be aware of what that container is made of! Many of these containers meet metal leaching standards only if ñwaterî is stored in them. However, they may not meet leaching standards if you elect to fill them with more acidic liquids such as fruit juices or mixed drinks! We recommend using containers stamped with ñ18/8 Stainless Steelî or ñ304 food-grade.î Keep your beer icy cold and your guests warm; add a set of Bonefish Pints to your cart! True pint, exactly 16 oz to meet global expectations 18/8 stainless steel- super high grade, guaranteed not to corrode Stackable without locking together Engineered lip for no-spill sipping Care: Dishwasher safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l7H6A7feL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonefish Gear","source_asin":"B0128EYLNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0128EYLNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0128EYLNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
