window.products.push({"id":237323,"name":"Orrefors Personalized Crystal IPA Glasses, Set of 4 Custom Engraved German Beer Glasses for IPA, Craft Beer, India Pale Ale","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O0RtaDtVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring your IPA's and craft beers to the next level with the unapologetically exquisite India Pale Ale Glasses by the legendary crystal artisans Orrefors. These IPA Beer Glasses are robust and a little different, just like the beer after which they’re named. IPA is a beer that is rich in hops, malt aroma and flavor. The high content of hops and malt in an IPA produces a lot of aroma and taste, and usually a higher alcohol content, so an IPA glass should definitely have a form that doesn’t hide anything, but emphasizes aroma and taste by narrowing at the top. The unique shape of the Orrefors IPA glass takes elements from existing beer glasses and combines them into one perfect vessel that’s designed to help beer drinkers experience American IPAs in the best possible way. Ridges in the hollow stem help to aerate the beer by creating more surface area and friction, which helps to break up the aromatics as the liquid makes contact with the solid sides of the glass. The length and inverted shame of the bowl on the top of the glass helps to push the aromatics in a focused stream towards your nose, instead of dispersing them into the air, as you’d see with a standard pint glass. Each Orrefors IPA Glass stands at 6\" in Height with a 3.33\" Diameter and 15.5 ounce capacity for your favorite brew, and is meticulously crafted from pure, brilliant lead-free crystal. Each set includes a total of four glasses. Let our engraving team make this premium beer glass set one of a kind by adding a custom engraving to both glasses. Use up to three lines of text, 15 characters max per line. Click 'Customize Now' to begin your order and review engraving options. ITEM SPECIFICATIONS Manufacturer: Orrefors Model: IPA Glass Material: Lead-Free Crystal Quantity: 4 Glasses Capacity: 15.5oz Height: 6\" Diameter: 3.33\" Orrefors Gift Box Packaging Made in Germany","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O0RtaDtVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orrefors","source_asin":"B08DL91BT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DL91BT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DL91BT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
