window.products.push({"id":237354,"name":"St Patricks Day Kitchen Towels and Dishcloths Set of 4, Happy St. Patrick's Day Dish Towels, Leprechaun Gnomes Irish Green Truck Hat Shamrocks Tea Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811uu8CLyAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Microfiber ❤【SIZE and MATERIALS】Measures approximately 16\" x 23.5\", 4 pack. The st patricks kitchen towels clearance prime are made of 100% microfiber. Lint free and quick dry ability make it great for all around use, while also being great on glass. ❤【UNIQUE DESIGN】Our happy st patrick's day decorative dish towels and dishcloths sets for the kitchen or terry cloths for the bathroom! Leprechaun and Shamrocks design that are sure to brighten up your day. We kept them simple and elegant to match any theme and colors. The st patricks gnomes with green hat dish drying towels are an easy and cheap way to update your home. ❤【EASY CARE】Safe to clean in a machine washer and dryer. All towels are pre-washed and preshrunk to help enhance its quality. Wash in cold water, hang to dry, not bleachable. ❤【MULTI-PURPOSE】Can be used for drying hands and dishes, sopping up a quick mess, cleaning counter tops, tables or windows, wrapping delicate items and more perfect st patrick's gift for all occasions; You can fold these gold pot coins and clovers dishtowels up on your kitchen counter, hang them above the handles of your dishwasher or oven, or use them to decorate your cabinets to give your kitchen a more vibrant look. ❤【BEST GIFT】Decorated with irish green truck and leprechaun with shamrocks printed and happy st. patricks day blessing quotes, that will surprise your family and friends, make a perfect saint patricks housewarming gift for new home or renovation, St. Patrick's Day, birthday, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811uu8CLyAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonsai Tree","source_asin":"B09FST66VS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FST66VS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FST66VS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
