window.products.push({"id":237437,"name":"Neck Hero MM 2 Medium Neck Support Pillows Neck Roll for Neck Pain - Side, Back & Stomach Sleepers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719ZOEaGDpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Finding the perfect neck pillow is a tough task! With so many brands, fillings, and sizes out there, you can spend hundreds of dollars and still not be happy with your choice. We created Neck Hero neck pillow because we believe that everyone deserves neck support and you shouldn't have to pay an arm and a leg to get it! Give your pillow an upgrade today with Neck Hero! Standard shaped bed pillows are only designed to support your head and NOT your neck. Experts agree that it is best to use a pillow that keeps your cervical spine in neutral alignment—meaning, the natural curve of your neck is supported and maintained. Neck Hero's patented neck pillow design does just that! Step 1: Pick It - Pick your level of support (see guide Step 2: Clip it - Try your Neck Hero in several positions with and without your primary pillow. Choose the position that is most comfortable, then use the clips on the pillowcase to attach your Neck Hero so it will stay right where you put it. Step 3: Enjoy it - Sleep on your Neck Hero in the desired position and adjust it accordingly to get the exact support you need. Even moving the Neck Hero up or down slightly can make a huge difference! Thank you for your business! How Much Support Do I Need? Basic Guide: Choose the size that best describes you -  -Most small to medium body frames prefer our most popular size Soft Neck Hero  (if you like a firm feeling pillow choose a Medium) -Most larger body frames prefer the Medium Neck Hero  (if you like a flat pillow choose a Soft) ONLY choose Firm if you prefer a very firm pillow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719ZOEaGDpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neck Hero","source_asin":"B07CP7ZRKB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CP7ZRKB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CP7ZRKB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
