window.products.push({"id":237461,"name":"MYlovelylands 20x28 inch Gold Arched Mirror for Bathroom Vanity Mirror or Wall Decor Arch Mirror Brushed Metal Frame Wall Mounted Mirror for Bathroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mmgZjoGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-Quality:This arched mirror provides HD image and clear reflection without distortion.Ideal for decorative bathroom vanity mirror to make the space more brighter and spacious Exquisite Craftsmanship:The underside of this arch mirror is decorated with round corners which is more beautiful and safer than the right angle edge. Please note that there will be a small seam where the metal comes together due to the special manufacturing process Stable and Quick Installation:This bathroom wall mirror has TWO pre-installed mirror hooks, which make it more stable and wobble-free.All needed accessories are provided. Just punch a hole in suitable and screw on, you can easily hang this black mirror on the wall within 10 minutes Enhanced Packaging:Compared with other similar items, we have made a great improvement in packaging to prevent scratches, breaks and other problems. In addition, we wrap the arch wall mirror in the film to ensure that the polystyrene foam will not be embedded in the mirror Perfect After-sales Service:If the wall mirror is damaged when it arrives, or you don't absolutely love our product, please contact us in time and we'll offer you 24/7 attentive customer service and satisfaction guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mmgZjoGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MYlovelylands","source_asin":"B0B5Z9FCK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5Z9FCK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5Z9FCK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":237462,"name":"Flash Furniture Queen Platform Bed | Queen Size Platform Bed Frame with Headboard","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":387.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sNbJhxX9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade the style and comfort of your bedroom with a queen size upholstered platform bed. The attractive construction blends contemporary dcor with a plush feel to deliver everything you want from a queen-size bed frame. Crafted from sturdy plywood, the frame features a low-profile base and open design for a sleek, modern aesthetic. A center support leg and 15 wooden slats provide even support under your mattress with no box spring required. The upholstered headboard features an elegant grey fabric decorated with a button-tufted design. A decorative tufted border along the headboard adds to the clean look, making this queen bed perfect for modern spaces. Gentle cushioning inside the headboard lends a plush feel for a stylish look that also cushions your head. Enjoy easy mattress set-up and everyday maintenance with the open design of this platform bed frame. The low profile makes it easy to lift your mattress into place while offering easy access for cleaning underneath the bed. With no footboard, it's easy to quickly make your bed in the morning without any extra reaching around. Discover the perfect upgrade for your bedroom space with our queen platform bed frame with headboard. The sturdy, low-profile design is durable and supportive while the upholstered design and tufted trim lend the perfect touch of contemporary style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sNbJhxX9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B0BCDP3PBD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCDP3PBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCDP3PBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
