window.products.push({"id":237464,"name":"Yarcos Air Purifiers for Home Allergies Pets Hair in Bedroom, H11True HEPA Filters, 17db Air Cleaner, Odor Eliminators, Ozone Free, Remove 99.97% Dust","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZLIJ15KZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product SPEC Product Name: YARCOS Bedroom Regimen Air Purifier Product Part No. : XJ-120ZB-B Blowing Rate: 80m³/h Purification Modes：H11 HEPA filter +Negative Air Ions (NAIs) NAIs Density：25000pcs/cm³ Power Adapter：12V 1A Noise Level：Sleep Mode 16db / Strongest Fan 28db Votage: 100-240 v Power: 3.8W Product Size: 11*6*12 inches Product Weight：2.8 lb Operations: 1.Plug in YARCOS Bedroom Regimen Air Purifier 2.Tough the on/off button once, the power on with the strongest fourth gears of fan speed. 3.Control the fan speed by touching the on/off button when the power is on. 4.Press the the on/off button for 3 sec, the power off. How is Negative Air Ions working ? Negative Air Ions react rapidly with particles and chemical pollutants in the air to clean the air efficiently. This system can work continuously for 24 hours, and will not produce harmful substances such as ultraviolet and ozone, so as to avoid environmental pollution. Packaging included: YARCOS Air Purifier x1, Power Adapter x1, Manual x1 Tips: The effect of Negative Air Ions (NAIs) is the best, when the relative humidity of the environment is above 55%; If you are in a dry environment, in order to ensure the product effect, it is recommended to use a fog-free humidifier at the same time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZLIJ15KZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yarcos","source_asin":"B09M2KXZ6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M2KXZ6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M2KXZ6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":237465,"name":"Evideco French Home Goods Bamboo Beaded Door Curtain 65 Strings 79\" W x 36\" W Taupe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yHggTfMML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful handmade grey taupe bamboo sticks beaded door curtain is made of 65 strands, about 3/8\" apart. Add a twist to an ordinary space with this nice beaded door curtain, it such an easy and affordable way to add color, character and style to your space. You can hang your door sticks curtain over a door panel to disguise the clutter or you can use them as window curtain, closet curtain, room divider or wall decoration. Hang it over an existing door, without removing the door or cover and beautify a doorway, gateway, or use it as an wall art, it will look fabulous. Last but not least, a door curtain can be used as a window treatment to add a decorative touch to a boring window! Use for just about any door way - use your imagination! Installation is super easy. Bamboo bead curtains are very easy to install and can be simply relocated from one place to another. Each curtain comes with two hooks attached to the grey taupe wood rod and 4 screw hooks supplied (2 square bend screws and 2 lag thread screws) to attach your curtain to the wall or to the ceiling. This door curtain measures 78.8\"H x 35.5\"W (200 x 90 cm). The width of the curtain can be shortened by cutting the hanging bar or else can be simply hung on the inside or outside of the doorway. To adjust the height, you can hang the curtain upper or lower on your wall or door frame. Hand-made, color grey taupe, 2 colors available : off-white or grey taupe. Imported from France, made in Vietnam. Clean with a damp cloth. NOTE: Beaded door curtains regardless of their type or the number of the strands cannot provide 100% privacy, especially if the light is coming from both sides of the curtain. To provide some privacy, light should be off on that side of the curtain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yHggTfMML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evideco French Home Goods","source_asin":"B08VFVLR5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VFVLR5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VFVLR5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
