window.products.push({"id":237506,"name":"HERA BEAUTY Super Absorbent Bath Mat, Quick Dry Bath Mat, Non Slip Rubber Bathroom Rugs, Easy to Clean Machine Washable Thin Bath Mats for Bathroom(Bi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v9EDb3smL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🇺🇸【SUPER ABSORBENT BATH MAT】: These bath mats for bathroom are thin and comfortable which are made of technical diatomite materials. They can absorb as much water as possible from your wet feet after shower. This super absorbent bath mat will make water be absorbed extreme quickly that you will see water droplets disappear very quickly on the surface within 1~2 seconds (Compared to other most will be more than 3~5 seconds). We have confidence this is a real super absorbent bath mat. 🇺🇸【NON-SLIP SUPER ABSORBENT BATH MAT】: This super absorbent bath mat has updated version slip-resistant rubber mesh on the back which can prevent the slipping. You will not be worried about the slipping after your shower or washing absolutely. Even on very slippery floor, the non-slip super absorbent bath mat remains in place. 🇺🇸【MULTIPLE-PURPOSE USAGE】: This super absorbent bath mat is only 0.16 inch thick. It is suitable in different seasons and places, such as bathroom, sink bathtub, under kitchen sinks, laundry room, entrance of house or garage, living room, bedroom etc. It could be used on the tile and wooden floor with radiant heat which is below 122°F(50℃). You won’t feel cold in winter and won’t feel hot in summer when step on it. It also could be a great choice of a small gift for friends. 🇺🇸【EASY TO CLEAN】: Unlike traditional bathmats, these bath mats for bathroom won’t contain hair, dust and dirt. If there is muddy or dust on it, only needs to be cleaned with a little detergent and clean water, and with a brush or sponge, which saves your time and energy. This super absorbent bath mat also can be machine-washable, but hand wash would be a better choice. 🇺🇸【SWEET NOTE & SATISFACTION GUARANTEE】: This super absorbent bath mat has great image which has crocodile pattern leather on the surface. Great quality product requires the proper care. Hand wash (by brush or sponge) would be a better choice and it needs air dry only! If you are not satisfied with our product with any problems, please email us and we will be honored to assist you to solve all the problems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61v9EDb3smL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HERA BEAUTY","source_asin":"B0BHQFZT6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHQFZT6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHQFZT6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
