window.products.push({"id":237681,"name":"HotMat Classic Food Warmer Tray - Foldable with Silicone and Adjustable Temperature - Circular Compact Warming Plate for Home Dinners, Parties and Buf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W9Ixi4UOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is HotMat Classic? It’s an innovative food warming tray that will simplify the cooking life of any professional chef, home cook, or host. The Classic keeps food warm for occasions such as parties, buffets, or family dinners. It’s even great for travel. Portable and Lightweight: When you need a quick and easy way to heat your food, HotMat Classic is perfect. Easy to set up, use, clean, and put away. This lightweight warming tray folds down to just a fraction of the space of other food warmers. Perfect for those with limited kitchen space and want to travel with their dishes. Circular Design Allows for Full Coverage: Unlike your traditional hot trays, HotMat Classic warming tray covers the full surface of your pots and pans… Leaving no pan cold. Dual Temperature: HotMat Classic's warming plates are divided into two preset warm (212°F) plates and two preset hot (302°F) plates to ensure various dishes are heated to perfection. Safety first, ETL and Zomet approved and complies with the strict safety standards for your peace of mind. Modern and Versatile: This sleek and stylish food tray warmer will look great in any kitchen or surface. It can be used with most types of pans, dishes, or bakeware to get optimal value for your money! A chic idea for a housewarming gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W9Ixi4UOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"homeart","source_asin":"B0BWSGBHZ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWSGBHZ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWSGBHZ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
