window.products.push({"id":237700,"name":"Lipo Bed Pillows for Sleeping with Pillow Cases,Pillows Queen Size Set of 2 - Hotel Pillows - Gusseted Pillow for Back, Stomach or Side Sleepers - Que","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MkspS88JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌙Pillow Insert & Pillowcase - Made in OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certified factory, an independent certification system that ensures textiles meet high safety and environmental standards. Unlike other brands, you will receive 2 packs of queen size pillows and 2 packs of satin pillowcases, your bed pillows will be cleaner and more hygienic. It really is a great gift for your family and friends. 🌙Tips: Since this pillow is vacuum packaged, it may not be able to fluff up when you first open it. You may put it into your dryer or exposet it to sunlight for a couple of hours, then it will fluff up nicely. 🌙 SOFT & FLUFFY - Pillow core made of down-like microfibre , Since our down alternative pillows are made with a great balance of softness and plump firmness, so whether you prefer soft or firm pillows. Whether you are a side sleeper, or back sleeper, and even some stomach sleeper. These pillows have a high loft, Great for all sleeping styles . These pillows are perfect for you! 🌙 Breathable Cover - The pillow cover is made of 100% Egyptian Microfiber fabric material to stay soft, breathable, and dry. Soft friendly cooling cover, a naturally breathable fabric that will keep you comfortable and cool as you sleep. Provide you the fluffy and cloud-like feeling.Suitable for side, stomach back and other sleepers. 🌙 EASY TO CARE - No fear of machine wash, it is not easy to be deformed after repeated machine wash and washing tests. After washing , dry it in the sun and pat a few times after drying to restore its original fluffy state. Warmstar provides super strong and durable bed pillows.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MkspS88JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lipo","source_asin":"B0BNQF83RP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQF83RP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQF83RP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
