window.products.push({"id":237764,"name":"cubaco SPORTS WATER bottle with straw lid large 2l - graduated, portable, and thermo mug for outdoor travel - bpa-free (PINK)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WrDJL3BkL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Safety Lock Design: Our water bottle features a unique safety lock that prevents water leakage caused by accidental touch and keeps it away from dust. With just one key, you can easily open the lid for convenient drinking. The bottle won't leak even when placed upside down, ensuring good airtightness and no fear of water spilling in your bag. BPA-Free and Non-Toxic: Made from quality food-grade eco-friendly pp+silica gel+pc materials, our water bottle is BPA-free and non-toxic. The food-grade soft silicone nozzle helps protect your gums, ensuring safe and healthy drinking. Portable and Lightweight: With a design that includes a carrying ring, our water bottle is easy to take with you wherever you go. It's light enough to carry around due to its lightweight material, so you won't have to worry about the bottle being too heavy. Large Capacity: Our water bottle has a generous 2L capacity, providing enough water to meet your daily needs. The accurate scale on the bottle helps you check the actual amount of water intake, making it easier for you to maintain a healthy lifestyle. Ideal Gift: With its unique design and a variety of colors to choose from, our water bottle makes for an excellent gift idea. It's the perfect way to help your friends and family develop healthy drinking habits, while also providing them with a stylish and functional water bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WrDJL3BkL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"cubaco","source_asin":"B0BY3CH316","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-237764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY3CH316","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY3CH316","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
